From: FocusLamp local maintenance patch
Subject: [LOCAL C2] Reduce Xiaozhi WebSocket reconnect delay to 2000 ms

This patch restores only the C2 reconnect-delay change if managed_components
is refreshed or downloaded again.

Important: managed_components currently has two independent local change sets:
1. This C2 change in
   managed_components/espressif__esp_xiaozhi/src/esp_xiaozhi_websocket.c
2. The 2026-10-05 WebSocket diagnostic logging in
   managed_components/espressif__esp_websocket_client/esp_websocket_client.c
   Restore that separately from:
   C:/Users/Administrator/WorkBuddy/2026-09-28-16-51-39/baseline/ws_diag_20261005/ws_diag_20261005.patch

Do not modify dependencies.lock for this local patch.
---
diff --git a/managed_components/espressif__esp_xiaozhi/src/esp_xiaozhi_websocket.c b/managed_components/espressif__esp_xiaozhi/src/esp_xiaozhi_websocket.c
--- a/managed_components/espressif__esp_xiaozhi/src/esp_xiaozhi_websocket.c
+++ b/managed_components/espressif__esp_xiaozhi/src/esp_xiaozhi_websocket.c
@@ -244,7 +244,7 @@ esp_err_t esp_xiaozhi_websocket_start(esp_xiaozhi_websocket_handle_t handle)
         .crt_bundle_attach = esp_crt_bundle_attach,
         .disable_auto_reconnect = false,
         .enable_close_reconnect = true,
-        .reconnect_timeout_ms = 5000,
+        .reconnect_timeout_ms = 2000,
     };
 
     if (websocket->websocket_client) {
